I get my parcel delivered to a Locker?",{"id":309,"href":310,"linkText":311},"YhzTYRIAAC4A7Y0l","\u002Ffaqs\u002Flockers\u002Fthe-locker-is-too-small-for-my-parcel-what-can-i-do","The locker is too small for my parcel, what can I do?",{"id":313,"href":314,"linkText":315},"YhzT2BIAAC0A7Y9S","\u002Ffaqs\u002Flockers\u002Fwhat-is-a-locker","What is a Locker?",{"id":317,"href":318,"linkText":319},"YhzSehIAACkA7Yjg","\u002Ffaqs\u002Flockers\u002Fim-having-trouble-with-the-locker-what-can-i-do","I'm having trouble with the Locker, what can I do?",{"id":321,"href":322,"linkText":323},"YhzRghIAACkA7YTp","\u002Ffaqs\u002Flockers\u002Fhow-do-i-use-a-locker","How do I use a Locker?",{"id":325,"href":326,"linkText":327},"YhzS9RIAAC0A7Ysk","\u002Ffaqs\u002Flockers\u002Fmy-barcode-isnt-scanning","My barcode isn't scanning","can-i-collect-a-parcel-from-a-parcelshop",{"titleTag":330,"metaDescription":331,"canonical":332,"subpath2":333,"category":342,"linkText":179,"additionalHelp":6,"slices":350},"Can I collect a parcel from a ParcelShop? | Evri","Find your nearest ParcelShop to pick up your parcel. See how the process works to make delivery work around you and your schedule.","can-i-collect-a-parcel-from-a-parcelshop.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ffaqs\u002Fparcelshops\u002Fcan-i-collect-a-parcel-from-a-parcelshop",{"id":334,"type":335,"tags":336,"lang":337,"slug":145,"first_publication_date":338,"last_publication_date":338,"uid":145,"link_type":339,"key":340,"isBroken":341},"Yhj0kBIAACgA3Cfn","subpath2",[],"en-gb","2022-02-25T15:24:03+0000","Document","adcf0d99-76d7-4c25-bb53-a6a16c1a1761",false,{"id":343,"type":344,"tags":345,"lang":337,"slug":145,"first_publication_date":347,"last_publication_date":348,"uid":145,"link_type":339,"key":349,"isBroken":341},"YitraREAAC4AQybq","faq-category",[346],"FAQs","2022-03-11T15:31:57+0000","2022-05-12T12:56:04+0000","dbe82240-8fb8-489f-ade0-eb519843d789",[351],{"variation":352,"version":353,"items":354,"primary":356,"id":410,"slice_type":411,"slice_label":412},"default-slice","sktwi1xtmkfgx8626",[355],{},{"content":357},[358,362,366,373,376,389,398,401],{"type":359,"text":179,"spans":360,"direction":361},"heading1",[],"ltr",{"type":363,"text":364,"spans":365,"direction":361},"paragraph","Yes, you can! If you’re not going to be home or just prefer the flexibility of picking up your parcel at a time that suits you, choosing a ParcelShop collection is a great option. ",[],{"type":363,"text":367,"spans":368,"direction":361},"If you’re ordering from a retailer, simply select Evri ParcelShop at checkout and choose the location that works best for you - whether it’s near home, work, or somewhere convenient along your daily route. ",[369],{"start":370,"end":371,"type":372},50,65,"strong",{"type":363,"text":374,"spans":375,"direction":361},"But that’s not the only way! You can also collect your parcel from a ParcelShop if: ",[],{"type":377,"text":378,"spans":379,"direction":361},"list-item","A personal sender or small business has chosen ParcelShop delivery for your item ",[380,388],{"start":381,"end":382,"type":383,"data":384},47,66,"hyperlink",{"link_type":385,"url":386,"target":387},"Web","\u002Four-services\u002Fparcelshop-delivery","_blank",{"start":381,"end":382,"type":372},{"type":377,"text":390,"spans":391,"direction":361},"Your delivery was originally scheduled to your home, but you chose to divert it to a ParcelShop instead (where available) ",[392,397],{"start":393,"end":394,"type":383,"data":395},70,79,{"link_type":385,"url":396,"target":387},"\u002Fguides\u002Fdivert-your-parcel",{"start":393,"end":394,"type":372},{"type":363,"text":399,"spans":400,"direction":361},"With over 9,000+ ParcelShops across the UK - many open early ‘til late and on weekends - you’re never far from a convenient collection point. ",[],{"type":363,"text":402,"spans":403,"direction":361},"Need help finding one? Find your nearest ParcelShop. ",[404,409],{"start":405,"end":406,"type":383,"data":407},23,52,{"link_type":385,"